CRC Press, 2011.</p><p>TLTK:</p><p>[1]&nbsp;Reiner Korthauer,&nbsp;Lithium-Ion Batteries: Basics and Applications,&nbsp;Springer Berlin, Heidelberg, 2018.</p><p>[2]&nbsp;A.G. Olabi, Renewable energy and energy storage systems,Energy,Volume 136,2017, Pages 1-6.</p><p>[3]&nbsp;Md Mustafizur Rahman, Abayomi Olufemi Oni, Eskinder Gemechu, Amit Kumar, Assessment of energy storage technologies: A review,Energy Conversion and Management,&nbsp;Volume 223,2020,113295.</p>","en":"<p>
